/2071631637792931859"></p><p>Vidit Gujrathi (@viditchess) on X</p><p>Chess engines tell you the best move. But grandmasters are human, they don’t always play it. So I built “Kibitz”: a human move predictor for chess broadcasts. I trained this model on my Nvidia RTX 5080. Then I made it run as a business by itself. A channel buys the overlay,</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/viditchess/status/2071631637792931859?s=48">https://x.com/viditchess/status/2071631637792931859?s=48</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/wednesday-assorted-links-560.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-560">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/viditchess/status/2071631637792931859?s=48</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/viditchess/status/2071631637792931859?s=48</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 15:35:28 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Are philosophers absurd?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://academic.oup.com/aristotelian/advance-article/doi/10.1093/arisoc/aoag025/8721275?login=false">https://academic.oup.com/aristotelian/advance-article/doi/10.1093/arisoc/aoag025/8721275?login=false</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/wednesday-assorted-links-560.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-560">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://academic.oup.com/aristotelian/advance-article/doi/10.1093/arisoc/aoag025/8721275?login=false</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://academic.oup.com/aristotelian/advance-article/doi/10.1093/arisoc/aoag025/8721275?login=false</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 15:35:28 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Anthropic on the reconstruction of Fable 5]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/redeploying-fable-5">https://www.anthropic.com/news/redeploying-fable-5</a></p><p>s